{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 8, :comments ["<b>Who covers</b> — the meaning is that He shows mighty deeds at all times, in the manner of: \"who does great things,\" and after it is written \"who gives rain.\"" "<b>And the meaning of who covers</b> — that the essence of the heavens is pure." "<b>Who makes mountains grow</b> — for they are dry and hard."], :book :psalms, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 147, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Ibn Ezra on Psalms -- Daat" "http://www.daat.ac.il/he-il/tanach/parshanut_hamikra/full-text/eben-ezra/tehilim"] ["Wikisource Mikraot Gedolot" "http://en.wikisource.org/wiki/Mikraot_Gedolot/"] ["Tanakh, Venice, 1617-1619" "https://dlib.rsl.ru/viewer/01007514045#?page=4"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T19:43:00.518583591Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}